Package: liner-notes
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), adduser
Description: Multi-user bulletin board system
 Liner Notes provides message boards, mail, file storage, chat and Door games.
 Installation or upgrade never starts or restarts services.

Package: liner-notes-web
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, liner-notes (= ${binary:Version}), python3-aiohttp (>= 3.11)
Description: Optional browser interface for the Liner Notes BBS
 An independent HTTP connector. Its default HTTP listener is loopback only.

Package: liner-notes-link
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, liner-notes (= ${binary:Version}), python3-cryptography (>= 43)
Description: Optional signed shared-board connector for Liner Notes
 Mutually authenticated BBS-to-BBS synchronization. Identity and trusted
 peers must be configured explicitly before use.
